OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill be cloudy with scattered showers
OL,7,Facross Shetland, frequent over Orkney.
OL,8,FFrequent showers spread to Shetland
OL,9,Ffor a time around midnight. Becoming
OL,10,Fmainly dry towards morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA cloudy and mostly dry
OL,13,Fstart but some showers over Shetland
OL,14,Ffor a time. Strong winds and outbreaks
OL,15,Fof locally heavy rain spread northeast
OL,16,Fduring the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
