OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FFrequent
OL,6,Fshowers and becoming windy on Sunday.
OL,7,FFrequent showers clear and the wind
OL,8,Feases down Monday. Strong winds,
OL,9,Fshowery rain return from Monday night
OL,10,Fand continue through Tuesday.
